  "LongDescription": "PRAN Mango Pickle is a tangy and flavorful condiment crafted from fresh raw mangoes and a blend of traditional spices. Seasoned with mustard seeds, fenugreek, cumin, garlic, and chilies, and preserved in spiced oil, it delivers an authentic taste that complements rice, paratha, or snacks. Available in 400g, this ready-to-eat pickle is produced by PRAN Agro Ltd. in Bangladesh. Its rich, zesty flavor and consistent quality make it a staple in Bangladeshi households and a favorite among pickle enthusiasts worldwide.",
